# 🌍 UrbanMind

## Real-Time Urban Intelligence Platform

UrbanMind is an AI + Big Data powered Smart City Intelligence platform designed to monitor, analyze, forecast, and visualize urban environmental conditions in real time.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 📊 Dashboard
- Real-time urban monitoring
- Live KPI cards
- Health score
- AI recommendations

### 📈 Analytics
- Urban scoring engine
- City ranking
- Statistical insights

### 🔮 Forecast
- Temperature prediction
- Humidity forecasting
- Risk detection
- Confidence analysis

### 🌍 Geo Intelligence
- Digital Twin map
- City health visualization
- Geo ranking

### 🖥 Monitor Center
- System monitoring
- Dataset tracking
- AI status monitoring

### 🤖 Urban AI Assistant
- Chat interface
- Urban insights
- Smart recommendations

### ⚙ Settings
- Theme control
- Export system
- Refresh management

---

# 🏗 Architecture

```text
Producer
↓

Weather Dataset

↓

Analytics Engine

↓

Forecast Engine

↓

Geo Intelligence

↓

Monitor Center

↓

AI Assistant

↓

Export Layer
```

---

# 🧠 Tech Stack

### Frontend
- Streamlit

### Backend
- Python

### Data
- Pandas
- NumPy

### Visualization
- Plotly
- Folium

### AI / ML
- Scikit-Learn
- Joblib

### Big Data
- Kafka
- Spark

